{"reviewId": "420927991_84IKf6P0f", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "滞胀：经济停滞（GDP增长低迷/衰退）与高通货膨胀、高失业率同时并存的经济现象，是经济政策的“两难困境”。\n通缩：社会物价总水平持续下跌，伴随货币供应量减少、需求疲软，可能引发企业盈利下降、债务负担加重等连锁反应。\n简单记：滞胀是“又慢又贵”，通缩是“又冷又便宜”。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "12067-12106", "abstract": "第五次康波以来，并没有出现类似第四次康波的滞胀问题，而是表现出明显的通缩特征，", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "420927991_84IKf6P0f", "userVid": 420927991, "topics": [], "createTime": 1763348879, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 420927991, "name": "被迫养生的粥粥同学", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/kMaz9nc8bgJI8vOQ4eaaZ1nSWlhBz6YK8HwaL9VYEFo0ttmDaJhdYgsjnUVX2SyONeX3vEuLgiaY/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "被迫养生的粥粥同学", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M5-0-10", "desc": "读完书籍", "title": "读完书籍", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 83, "likes": [{"userVid": 39853027, "name": "李nick", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83er5NoicLgxD5fGwZ7DXRt9yNiaFbL5rayrlPuewYXwUDphd9ibZ3y42Ribvg3rR66jicMEdxUpW4EVXibyg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [{"content": "好嘛，现在是通缩，消费低迷，需求疲软，企业利润下降，", "reviewId": "420927991_84IKf6P0f", "toCommentId": "420927991_84IKf6P0f_c1